* OrderPizza: orders a pizza
* CancelOrder: cancels an order
* GetOrderStatus: gets the status of an order
* GetMenu: gets the menu
* GetDeliveryTime: gets the delivery time
* GetPaymentMethod: gets the payment method
* GetContactInformation: gets the contact information
* GetHelp: gets help
* GetFAQ: gets the FAQ
* GetAbout: gets the about page
* GetPrivacyPolicy: gets the privacy policy
* GetTermsOfService: gets the terms of service

