* An AWS API Gateway named "cat-pics"
* An S3 bucket named "cat-pics-bucket"
* An AWS Lambda function named "cat-pics"
* An IAM role named "cat-pics-role"

The API Gateway is configured to allow users to upload cat pictures to the S3 bucket, and to provide a random cat picture on demand. The S3 bucket is configured to allow public access to the uploaded cat pictures. The Lambda function is configured to handle the API Gateway requests and to upload the cat pictures to the S3 bucket. The IAM role is configured to allow the Lambda function to access the S3 bucket.

